{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"C-星代数"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"C*-代数"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>$C^*$ 代数是一个 "},{"Local":{"url":"Banach代数","text":"Banach 代数"}},{"Plain":"配备运算 $(-)^*$, 满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$a^{**}=a$;</li>\n<li>$(a+b)^*=a^*+b^*$,</li>\n<li>$(\\lambda a)^* = \\bar\\lambda a^*$ ($\\lambda \\in\\mathbb{C}$),</li>\n<li>$(a b)^*=b^*a^*$;</li>\n<li>$\\|a^* a\\|=\\|a\\|^2$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$C^*$ 代数上的范数可由代数结构唯一确定, 因为谱半径公式给出\n$$\r\n\t\\|A\\|^2 = \\sup\\{|\\lambda|\\colon A^*A-\\lambda \\,\\text{不可逆}\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"vonNeumann代数","text":"von Neumann 代数"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}